30,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The budget is tighter than we thought, and off-site work doesn't bring in any regional funding.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Shion,,"It seems some past trials actually reduced readmissions, but joint clinics failed due to budget and rota disputes.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Midori,,"We have a nursing crisis on the wards, but the midwifery team actually has some unexpected capacity.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"The car park and rooms are completely full by midday, and the booking system ignores any non-slotted work.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"External data agreements take forever to sign, and home visits are often missed due to simple access issues.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Kenji, if the booking system is that limited, any program without fixed slots will be invisible.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Jonathan, that makes the funding issue worse if we can't prove the activity.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shizue, if home visits are unreliable, we should avoid programs that rely heavily on them.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Midori, that's a good point. We need something that fits the existing physical constraints.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, I agree. We should look for something that uses our internal strengths.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,We need a program that generates revenue on-site to offset the budget cut.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Shion,,And one that doesn't require complex joint-departmental agreements that might collapse.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Midori,,"Given the midwifery slack, a program utilizing them would be the most sustainable for staffing.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Kenji,,As long as it doesn't overflow the parking lot or the booking system.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Shizue,,Let's hope the candidates align with these realities.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
